Comment: The files in this source package are GPL-2.0-or-later, which is what
 their SPDX headers say. The binary is not: the build links UxPlay's protocol
 library (https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay), which is not distributed here. Most
 of that library is LGPL-2.1-or-later, but its playfair component is
 GPL-3.0-or-later, so the combined work -- and therefore the add-on as
 installed, which is what addon.xml declares -- is GPL-3.0-or-later.

